WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:19.461
Chuck & Dave: Oooh. We're so scared!

2
00:00:19.462 --> 00:00:21.414
Brad: You should be.

3
00:00:21.415 --> 00:00:23.811
Tina: I don't think they are serious.

4
00:00:23.812 --> 00:00:31.063
Brad: Well, they should be.

5
00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:34.668
Tina: Brad! Brad, let's go find Danny.

6
00:00:34.669 --> 00:00:38.110
Dave: Yeah, buzz off, you little pests.

7
00:00:38.111 --> 00:00:43.901
Chuck: Or we'll squash you like bugs!

8
00:00:43.902 --> 00:00:46.480
Tina: What were you going to do, fight them?

9
00:00:46.481 --> 00:00:49.676
Brad: I don't know. I just got so angry.

10
00:00:49.677 --> 00:00:51.318
Tina: We need to find Danny.

11
00:00:51.319 --> 00:00:53.691
I think he is upset.

12
00:00:53.692 --> 00:01:01.374
Brad: There's only one place he could be.

13
00:01:01.375 --> 00:01:03.017
Brad: Danny!

14
00:01:03.018 --> 00:01:05.098
Tina: Danny, are you okay?

15
00:01:05.099 --> 00:01:08.173
Brad: Why do you have mud on your face?

16
00:01:08.174 --> 00:01:14.670
Danny: I tripped and fell.

17
00:01:14.671 --> 00:01:17.915
Tina: Danny, you look terrible.

18
00:01:17.916 --> 00:01:22.863
Danny: I'm angry. And I'm going to get revenge on those bullies!

19
00:01:22.864 --> 00:01:28.200
Tina: Danny, calm down.

20
00:01:28.201 --> 00:01:31.123
Danny: I'm tired of being pushed around!

21
00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:33.601
Tina: Revenge and anger are not good.

22
00:01:33.602 --> 00:01:36.494
Danny: Being beaten up isn't good either!

23
00:01:36.495 --> 00:01:39.259
Brad: He's got a point there.

24
00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:40.862
Tina: Brad!

25
00:01:40.863 --> 00:01:44.060
Brad: Well, I want to get back at those bullies too.

26
00:01:44.061 --> 00:01:48.693
Brad: Even though it wasn't my pants they pulled down.

27
00:01:48.694 --> 00:01:51.509
Danny: Don't remind me!

28
00:01:51.510 --> 00:01:54.188
Tina: Maybe we should try to talk to them.

29
00:01:54.189 --> 00:01:56.228
Danny: Talking won't do anything!

30
00:01:56.229 --> 00:01:58.675
They're evil like Tristay.

31
00:01:58.676 --> 00:02:01.068
Danny: Did we "talk" with Tristay?

32
00:02:01.069 --> 00:02:03.827
Tina: That was a different situation!

33
00:02:03.828 --> 00:02:08.089
Danny: If Hopian were here, he would stomp those bullies.

34
00:02:08.090 --> 00:02:09.790
Tina: No, he wouldn't.

35
00:02:09.791 --> 00:02:15.058
Tina: He told us that he tried to talk with Tristay. Remember?

36
00:02:15.059 --> 00:02:19.701
Danny: Chuck and Dave must be stopped, or else they will pick on us forever.

37
00:02:19.702 --> 00:02:27.510
Tina: Be careful, or one day you'll be just like them.

38
00:02:27.511 --> 00:02:29.244
Danny: I don't want to talk to them!

39
00:02:29.245 --> 00:02:36.213
I want to hurt them!

40
00:02:36.214 --> 00:02:39.843
Tina: Danny, you're becoming just like Tristay!

41
00:02:39.844 --> 00:02:41.960
Danny: Me? Like Tristay?

42
00:02:41.961 --> 00:02:44.227
I'm the good guy.

43
00:02:44.228 --> 00:02:48.911
Tina: Please, Danny, don't seek revenge.

44
00:02:48.912 --> 00:02:52.243
Danny: Tina, you're either with me or against me.

45
00:02:52.244 --> 00:02:54.374
Tina: Danny, don't say that.

46
00:02:54.375 --> 00:02:56.006
Danny: Brad?

47
00:02:56.007 --> 00:02:57.394
Brad: I'm with you.

48
00:02:57.395 --> 00:03:01.170
Those bullies must be stopped.

49
00:03:01.171 --> 00:03:03.483
Danny: Tina? Are you with us?

50
00:03:03.484 --> 00:03:09.009
Tina: No. You are my friends, but nothing can be gained from revenge.

51
00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:14.813
Danny: Fine. Then go.
